<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine debut Eurobond to be in dollars.</title>
<headline>Ukraine debut Eurobond to be in dollars.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine will denominate its first Eurobond expected to be launched in September in dollars, Finance Minister Ihor Mityukov said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The first issue will be denominated in dollars, but this is only the beginning. Once we are on the markets, we will be looking for other sources of money,&quot; Mityukov told a news conference.</p>
</text>
